					"nextDialogs": [
						740831020
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740831020,
					"content": "珀西芙…你不会是想说，就像派蒙叫派蒙一样，那位来客就叫那位来客？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831021
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831021,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831022
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831022,
					"content": "啊哈！果然是这样，我就说，我也是很聪明的嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831023,
						740831024
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831023,
					"content": "这名字太怪了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831025
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740831025,
					"content": "那位来客，珀西芙，知识，邦邦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831026
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831026,
					"content": "嗯…你是说那位来客帮你学会知识？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831027
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831027,
					"content": "珀西芙！十分很多。语言，智慧…十分很多。",
