					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831031,
					"content": "美露莘…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831032
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831032,
					"content": "是你帮他守护这里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831033
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740831033,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831034
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831034,
					"content": "居然是这样…那位来客究竟是什么人？他为什么需要你帮他守护这里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831035
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831035,
					"content": "而且这里确实发生了一些不好的事，我们看到的石碑，上面的字都被人毁掉了，也出现了不少污秽…有敌人吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831036
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831036,
					"content": "好奇派蒙，珀西芙！但是时间，十分很不多。",
